### Med-RAG API requests — for the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client)
### Start the server first: python main.py
### Click "Send Request" above any block below once it's running.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@apiKey = dev-key-change-in-prod

### Health check — no API key required
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Runtime metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Happy-path query — demo patient MRD 20001 (Type 2 Diabetes, 5 visits)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "mrd_number": "20001",
  "query": "How has the patient's blood glucose control changed across visits?"
}

### Diagnosis lookup
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "mrd_number": "20001",
  "query": "What is the patient's diagnosis?"
}

### Guardrail test — out-of-scope topic (expect 400 Unsupported)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "mrd_number": "20001",
  "query": "What is the patient's outstanding billing balance?"
}

### Guardrail test — unsupported doc type (expect 400 Unsupported)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "mrd_number": "20001",
  "query": "Can you interpret the patient's most recent MRI scan?"
}

### Invalid MRD test (expect 404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "mrd_number": "99999",
  "query": "What is the patient's diagnosis?"
}
